  "body_text": "Transform Your Sequencing Data into Actionable Insights\nBioinformatics\n        LDgenX provides tailored bioinformatics solutions for research, biodiversity, and innovation projects.\n            Approaches\n        \n        Metabarcoding\nMetagenomics\nRAD-seq\nWhole-Genome Sequencing (WGS)\nRNA-seq\nEpigenomics\nGenome-Wide Association Studies (GWAS)\nLong-Read Sequencing\n    \n            Services\n        1234567891011121314\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
